        "gg2Idy_Cc-N_text": "<p>Recurpay stands out as one of the most merchant-friendly subscription platforms I’ve worked with. It’s built to give brands real flexibility without the usual complexity or overhead.<br>&nbsp;</p><p>For brands focused on retention and LTV, it checks every box. Fast setup, smart features, and no need for a dedicated retention hire. It just works, and it works well.</p>",
