        "gg2JscxQiZs_text": "<p><strong>Build a Box</strong></p>",
        "gg3jdbaWYnO_text": "<p>Delight your subscribers with free gifts, tiered discounts, and surprise rewards - all automated.</p>",
        "ggAvfYbucIt_text": "<p>Support any routine - from hyperactive puppies to chill cats, with flexible weekly, monthly, or custom deliveries.</p>",
        "ggIFGgrqe9M_text": "<p><strong>Recurpay Bots</strong></p>",
        "ggKzFKS3Tr7_text": "<p>Customisable Subscription Widget</p>",
        "ggLliRZ8i9l_text": "<p><strong>Customer Self-Serve Portal</strong></p>",
        "ggNYvxp4HgQ_text": "<p>Track revenue, churn and retention. No complicated reports - just clear, real-time insights that help you make better decisions.</p>",
        "ggOd2wQIVBv_text": "<p>Give customers complete control to skip, pause, reschedule, or edit — so you get fewer support tickets and they stay subscribed longer.</p>",
        "gggBHqty_DJ_text": "<p><strong>Analytics &amp; Insights</strong></p>",
        "gggtUy22a9j_text": "<p>Let customers mix and match treats, toys, food, and more into a personalized subscription box they’ll look forward to every time.</p>",
        "ggn2xEaVym5_label": "<p>Claim 30 Days Free Trial</p>",
        "ggojFLH53CK_text": "<p>Launch fast with a no-code widget that fits your brand perfectly with full control over the design</p>",
        "ggwNX5JHoOr_text": "<p><strong>Flexible Delivery Options</strong></p>"
      },
